  o Minor bugfixes (controller interface):
    - In the unusual case where the torrc option AllowNonRFC953Hostnames
      is set to 1, a local user could request a socks hostname with
      surprise characters (like newlines) that caused mischief on
      the control port. Now we sanitize those addresses when they are
      reported in control events or GETINFO responses. Fixes bug 41283;
      bugfix on 0.1.1.1-alpha.
